    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Distinctive Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Funded pension system</strong>, but be careful, you can lose it <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/44d1c1145aa001672d667175b458e19b.webp?t=1749477331\" /></div><br></li><li><strong>Huge selection of character enhancements</strong>, from your favorite vodka to the tame bear<br></li><li><strong> Carefully thought-out economic system</strong>, in which the main currency is the bottle <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/3750fc43c181a1f2eabae8fd1fe26b6d.webp?t=1749477331\" /></div><br></li><li><strong> Many costumes </strong> allowing you to be fashionable and attractive, and therefore increasing income<br></li><li> <strong> A rich selection of locations, </strong> reflecting the entire path of the Russian Man<br></li><li> <strong> Music </strong> reflecting the Russian soul<br></li><li> <strong> Voice acting </strong> from cult Russian personalities <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/9facc9c6c15d945639d22ab9bea35946.webp?t=1749477331\" /></div></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Fascinating events, among which: </h2>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong> Choice </strong> of the President of the Russian Federation <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/6aa8560cc127125f039d4ffb07639a7e.webp?t=1749477331\" /></div><br></li><li> <strong> Invasion </strong> of foreign invaders<br></li><li> <strong> Hardbass </strong> in the front door <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/0dc9e8c3c81c3b94af0f2715ad8515db.webp?t=1749477331\" /></div><br></li><li> <strong> And other </strong> secret events </li></ul><br>Try to avoid the jail! <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/ef72485f207c4455215a6d2768f8da93.webp?t=1749477331\" /></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070330/extras/4020fd41afadf7ef781be20a1c069342.avif?t=1749477331\" /></div>",
